      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TASMAN BAY (7) shed the maiden tag over this track and trip when resuming and is sure to have derived a stack of confidence from that victory. Winning rider Allen sticks in the saddle and can go back-to-back without surprising. OOHLALOUVRE (5) has placed six of nine over this course and distance and rarely puts in a poor one. Include in calculations. LUVA FLUTTA (1) strips fitter third-up from the spell, gets 2kg off with the claim and draws the inside alley. Ticks a few boxes for a race of this calibre. The well-related AGENDA SETTER (2) (half to G2 winner Hidden Motive) will be better for that first-up hit-out and looks one for the exotics players. DON'TCHA LUV'ER (4) best of the rest while fresh.",
